--- !u!114 &88054364
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 88054363}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e5b15cacb0c881b4189ef342106e2f54, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NovelManager
  nameEndingScene: Sperm screen
  messages:
  - wiadomosc: 'Uro-chan wants to eat something sweet desu.

      C-could you maybe
      go and buy something for me, please?'
    odpowiedzi:
    - ' Chocolate pudding'
    - Strawberry Crepe
    - Choco-mint ice cream
    - 'Tri-colored dango '
    isItKillable: 1
    zlyWybor: 'Ah... It seems you don''t know Uro-chan at all... '
    dobryWybor: 'Yay! Thank you so much Player-kun!

      Uro-chan''s heart is so
      doki-doki! >///<'
  - wiadomosc: 'Have you watched that new anime?

      I wonder... What kind of
      anime Player-kun likes?'
    odpowiedzi:
    - Romance
    - Harem
    - Shounen
    - Ecchi
    isItKillable: 1
    zlyWybor: 'Uh... I didn''t know you like that kind of things...

      I guess
      Uro-chan was wrong about you'
    dobryWybor: "hee-hee\u2026 I think that's what most boys likes.\r\nI don't get
      it but...\r\nWill you show me your favorite one, next time?"
  - wiadomosc: "Ah! It's Player-kun!\r\nUro-chan is sooo happy to see you again hehe.\r\nUm...
      Player-kun\u2026\r\nYou like only me, right? Nobody else, right?\r\n"
    odpowiedzi:
    - Of course, I love you.
    - I'm in love with you.
    - 'Yes, I only like you. '
    - You worry about it too much.
    isItKillable: 1
    zlyWybor: No... no it's okay I get it...
    dobryWybor: 'B-baka! If u say it out loud like that... So embarrassing...!

      My
      heart can''t take it!'
  - wiadomosc: "Um... What if\u2026 only what if! Don't imagine too much! What if\u2026
      Player-kun took Uro-chan out on a date desu\u2026 Where would we go?\r\n"
    odpowiedzi:
    - ' Cinema'
    - Park
    - Cafe
    - Aquarium
    isItKillable: 1
    zlyWybor: '    Um... Are you into that kind of things...?     Player-kun, Sumimasen
      but i really have to go...'
    dobryWybor: '  P-player-kun! Only imagining us there makes my kokoro skip a beat...    
      Daisuki! Let''s go together~'
  - wiadomosc: "Ugh\u2026 Oh no...  P-player-kun?!\r\nOh I'm sorry, you startled
      me...\r\nYou see\u2026 I... I lost my beloved Tamagochi.\r\nCan you help me
      find it? Pretty please!\r\n"
    odpowiedzi:
    - ' Yes'
    - Okay
    - i'll help you
    - Sure
    isItKillable: 1
    zlyWybor: "Is that so\u2026 I can't count on you after all..."
    dobryWybor: 'Ah! You''re so sugoi! Nya... desuu!

      Thank you, arigato!

'
